# Agent skills are vendored by `npx skills add` into three places at once
# (.agents holds the files, .claude and agent/ are junctions to it). That is
# ~9.5MB of third-party markdown tripled, and none of it is our product.
#
# skills-lock.json is no longer tracked either — it is local tooling state, not
# part of the product. Restore a set with:
#   npx skills experimental_install
.agents/
.claude/
agent/
skills-lock.json
.codex/
.impeccable/
